        "verified_operation": "Graph blocks are conditioned on previous graph structure through an attention GNN. Parallel factorial Bernoulli components are combined as a mixture to capture dependencies between block edges. The author routine sums per-edge BCE within component and then takes component logsumexp with component weights.",
