          "Scope does not certify global novelty or full-operation nonexistence.",
          "GRAN is a graph generator, not the proposed source-incidence auxiliary for NCNC link prediction.",
          "Printed Eq7 omits explicit observation/complement powers; code resolves likelihood mechanics.",
          "Pinned code has optional positive BCE weighting and averages gate logits while printed Eq8 sums them. The local unweighted uniform mixture is an adaptation, not qualified native GRAN.",
          "No empirical values adopted; no full paper or native runtime/code certification."
